#: includes/class-wakechef-cook-mode-admin.php:164
msgid "The Cook view opens the recipe full screen: ingredients to tick off and one step at a time, in large text, with the screen kept awake. It reads the recipe data (schema.org Recipe) that recipe card plugins such as WP Recipe Maker, Tasty Recipes, Create, WP Delicious, and Recipe Card Blocks add to the page, so it works with any of them. The button appears next to the Cook Mode toggle, and only on pages that have recipe data."
