#: includes/class-wakechef-cook-mode-admin.php:261
msgid "Add the toggle to posts that are not WP Recipe Maker recipes, such as recipes from another plugin or written in the post content. You can also place it anywhere with the Cook Mode block or the [wakechef_cook_mode] shortcode."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wakechef-cook-mode-admin.php:301
msgid "Applies to posts. Leave all unchecked to include every category."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wakechef-cook-mode-admin.php:314
msgid "Cook Mode uses the Screen Wake Lock API to keep a visitor's screen on while they follow a recipe. It works in current versions of Chrome, Edge, Safari, and Firefox. In browsers without support, the toggle explains that Cook Mode is unavailable."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wakechef-cook-mode-admin.php:336
msgid "Need more? WakeChef Cook Mode Pro"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wakechef-cook-mode-admin.php:338
msgid "Step timers from the times in each step, several timers at once, and an alarm when time is up."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wakechef-cook-mode-admin.php:339
msgid "Serving scaling: readers change the servings and the ingredient amounts update, fractions and metric/US pairs included."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wakechef-cook-mode-admin.php:340
msgid "Cook Mode stats for each recipe, with a CSV download and optional Google Analytics 4 events. No cookies or IP addresses."
msgstr ""

